I just ran into a rather nasty bug/feature in nethack 3.0 patch level 6.
It was early in a so far successful game when I went to force a chest.
While that was going on I fell into fainting mode. The game did not give
me a chance to eat, each time I woke up I just kept forcing the chest and
then fainting again. My kitten tried valiantly to defend me from this
foolishness, but I was eventually pounded to death by sewer rats (a painfull
and ignominious death). Obviously when one starts fainting, one should stop
forcing, or at least force one turn at a time. I believe this is a problem
with eating too. While it's good that eating is interrupted when a monster
attacks, one should be able to eat one turn at a time so as to get out of
fainting mode.

